# API Module (`backend/src/api`)

## Purpose

This module likely contains sub-modules for different API versions or specific API functionalities that are structured separately from the main `routes`, `controllers`, and `services` pattern. For example, it might house health checks or user-specific API routes that are grouped differently.

## Main Components

- `healthCheck/`: Sub-module for health check endpoints.
- `user/`: Sub-module for user-related API endpoints (potentially an alternative or specific version of user routes).

## Key Functionalities (to be detailed)

- Health check implementation.
- User API endpoint definitions and handling.

## Interactions (to be detailed)

- How this module interacts with `server.ts` or `index.ts` for route registration.
- Dependencies on other services or repositories.
